    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 2 — Inbound Listener & Opt-Out Guard\n\nEvery inbound message is triaged into one of four verdicts **before** anything is written:\n\n| verdict | trigger | Airtable |\n|---|---|---|\n| `bounce` | DSN headers / mailer-daemon | `Status = Invalid` |\n| `auto` | out-of-office, `Auto-Submitted` | **nothing** — sequence continues |\n| `optout` | stop / unsubscribe / not interested / remove / wrong person | `Status = Do Not Contact` |\n| `replied` | anything else a human typed | `Status = Replied` + Slack/SMS |\n\nOpt-out matching runs on the **stripped** reply only. Our own signature says *reply \"stop\"* — matching the raw body would opt out every single person who answers.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 1300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "Note 7",
      "name": "Note 7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Safety guarantee\n`Replied` and `Do Not Contact` are terminal. Workflow 1 excludes them in its Airtable formula **and** re-checks each record immediately before sending. An opt-out is never downgraded back to `Replied`, whatever arrives later.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "Note 8",
      "name": "Note 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        160
      ]
    }
